  "name": {
   "zh": "面部去光照 · OpenDelight",
   "en": "Face Delighting · OpenDelight"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "OpenDelight 是面向面部外观采集的完全开源、高性能去光照先验。这张卡交付一套多层 EXR：rgba 是基础色（默认 ACEScg，按「输出颜色空间」），mask 是脸部遮罩；逐帧算整段会闪，这张卡只接一张画面。",
   "en": "OpenDelight is a fully open, high-performance delighting prior for facial appearance capture. This card delivers a multi-layer EXR: rgba is the base color (ACEScg by default, per Output Color Space) and mask is the face mask; computing a whole shot frame by frame flickers, so this card takes a single image."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-11T11:00:00",
  "deliverable": "face_maps",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
